  <section class="section faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title" data-glyde-faq>
    <header class="sectionHeading centerHeading">
      <p>FAQ</p>
      <h2 id="faq-title">Questions You Might Have.</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="faqList">
      <article class="faqItem" data-glyde-faq-item>
        <h3>
          <button
            id="faq-beginner-friendly-toggle"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="answer-beginner-friendly"
            data-glyde-faq-button
          >
            <span>Is GLYDE beginner-friendly?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="answer-beginner-friendly"
          class="faqAnswer"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-beginner-friendly-toggle"
          aria-hidden="true"
          data-glyde-faq-answer
        >
          <p>Yes. GLYDE is designed for people with little or no haircutting experience. Simply choose a hairstyle in the app and follow the step-by-step visual and audio guidance. As you cut, GLYDE automatically adjusts the blade to help you achieve a smooth, even result.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="faqItem" data-glyde-faq-item>
        <h3>
          <button
            id="faq-automatic-fade-toggle"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="answer-automatic-fade"
            data-glyde-faq-button
          >
            <span>How does GLYDE create an automatic fade?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="answer-automatic-fade"
          class="faqAnswer"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-automatic-fade-toggle"
          aria-hidden="true"
          data-glyde-faq-answer
        >
          <p>Built-in sensors track the clipper’s movement distance, speed, tilt, and angle in real time. GLYDE then automatically adjusts the cutting length as you move. The fade-band marks where the fade should begin, helping create a smooth and consistent transition between lengths.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="faqItem" data-glyde-faq-item>
        <h3>
          <button
            id="faq-self-haircut-toggle"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="answer-self-haircut"
            data-glyde-faq-button
          >
            <span>Can I use GLYDE to cut my own hair?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="answer-self-haircut"
          class="faqAnswer"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-self-haircut-toggle"
          aria-hidden="true"
          data-glyde-faq-answer
        >
          <p>Yes. GLYDE is designed to make self-haircuts easier with step-by-step guidance in the app. If it’s your first time, we recommend starting with a simple style, taking your time, and using a mirror for areas that are harder to see.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="faqItem" data-glyde-faq-item>
        <h3>
          <button
            id="faq-supported-hair-toggle"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="answer-supported-hair"
            data-glyde-faq-button
          >
            <span>What hairstyles and hair types does GLYDE support?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="answer-supported-hair"
          class="faqAnswer"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-supported-hair-toggle"
          aria-hidden="true"
          data-glyde-faq-answer
        >
          <p>GLYDE is designed primarily for short hairstyles, including buzz cuts, crew cuts, side parts, fades, tapers, and side-and-back touch-ups. It is not currently designed for long hairstyles, very curly hair, or skin fades.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="faqItem" data-glyde-faq-item>
        <h3>
          <button
            id="faq-mistake-prevention-toggle"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="answer-mistake-prevention"
            data-glyde-faq-button
          >
            <span>How does GLYDE help prevent mistakes?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="answer-mistake-prevention"
          class="faqAnswer"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-mistake-prevention-toggle"
          aria-hidden="true"
          data-glyde-faq-answer
        >
          <p>GLYDE continuously monitors how you move and holds the clipper. If you move too quickly or use an incorrect angle, it can adjust the cutting length and provide guidance to help reduce harsh lines, uneven transitions, and accidental overcutting. For the best results, follow the app and move slowly and steadily.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="faqItem" data-glyde-faq-item>
        <h3>
          <button
            id="faq-offline-toggle"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="answer-offline"
            data-glyde-faq-button
          >
            <span>Does the GLYDE app work offline?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="answer-offline"
          class="faqAnswer"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-offline-toggle"
          aria-hidden="true"
          data-glyde-faq-answer
        >
          <p>Yes. Once you’ve completed the initial setup and downloaded your chosen hairstyle, you can follow the guidance without Wi-Fi or mobile data. You’ll still need an internet connection to download new styles, sync content, and install updates.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="faqItem" data-glyde-faq-item>
        <h3>
          <button
            id="faq-battery-cleaning-toggle"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="answer-battery-cleaning"
            data-glyde-faq-button
          >
            <span>How long does the battery last, and how do I clean GLYDE?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="answer-battery-cleaning"
          class="faqAnswer"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-battery-cleaning-toggle"
          aria-hidden="true"
          data-glyde-faq-answer
        >
          <p>GLYDE has a 2600mAh battery and provides approximately two hours of runtime on a full charge. It charges via USB-C. GLYDE is not waterproof, so do not rinse or submerge it in water. After each use, clean the blade with the included brush and apply lubricating oil as needed.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

